        "text": "Whole wheat pita with black bean dip and sweet potato fries.",
        "text_sha256": "b332b0767ce05d014d173d3d6eba8be3342ecd2c9e1caa523a9270fb99d2c69d",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
