        "text": "Cheese-and-bean quesadilla with chopped spinach and a side of apple slices. Sauté frozen spinach and black beans, then top on a whole wheat tortilla and sprinkle with cheese. Cut the tortilla into little triangle sandwiches for easy eating.",
